        "y0": 0.47436759967615105,
        "x1": 0.9093118106617647,
        "y1": 0.48676859034170017
      },
      "text": "Hypertension was observed to be prevalent in",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09530213941045168,
        "y0": 0.4885543454991709,
        "x1": 0.9099365234375,
        "y1": 0.50095533616472
      },
      "text": "37.1% of the studied population with an insignificant gender difference. Rate of occurrence of hypertensives was found",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
