        "x1": 0.9118496422006303,
        "y1": 0.5152164874690595
      },
      "text": "to be significantly higher in type 2 diabetes (51.9%), obese subjects (45.2%), long-term smokers (49%) and alcohol",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
