        "x1": 0.9053220604648109,
        "y1": 0.5436643845964186
      },
      "text": "normotensive. However, when creatinine and blood urea nitrogen were included in the model, the significance was nul-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
