        "y0": 0.5597856965395483,
        "x1": 0.9104502445509454,
        "y1": 0.5721866872050975
      },
      "text": "reveals that the significance of hypertension as a parameter in predicting the risk of type 2 diabetes was influenced by",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
